  m_text: "ORDER OF THE SLICE\nBar Israelov\nLinoy Kasuker\n\nArt\nIngredient, bomb, kitchen,
    and application-icon art: AI-assisted image generation with team direction.\n\nUI\nKenney UI Pack \u2014
    Kenney.nl \u2014 CC0\nhttps://kenney.nl/assets/ui-pack\nKenney Game Icons \u2014 Kenney.nl
    \u2014 CC0\nhttps://kenney.nl/assets/game-icons\n\nAudio\nKenney Interface Sounds \u2014
    Kenney.nl \u2014 CC0\nhttps://kenney.nl/assets/interface-sounds\n8 Wet Squish, Slurp
    Impacts \u2014 Independent.nu \u2014 CC0\nhttps://opengameart.org/content/8-wet-squish-slurp-impacts\nDynamite
    Sound Effect \u2014 Listener \u2014 CC0\nhttps://opengameart.org/content/dynamite-sound-effect\nEmpacotatron
    \u2014 Fupi \u2014 CC0\nhttps://opengameart.org/content/empacotatron\n\nReference\nSlice
    and launch feel referenced from the public-domain Brackeys Fruit Ninja Replica.
    The implementation was rewritten for this project\u2019s Input System, pooling,
    and architecture. No Brackeys assets are included.\nhttps://github.com/Brackeys/Fruit-Ninja-Replica"
